msgstr "The following table lists the compilation options for Ascend NPU IR optimization, which are adapted to the hardware and software features of Ascend. **Usage**: During the autotune configuration phase, pass the values of the compilation options. For example, to enable the `multibuffer` option, pass `'multibuffer': True` to `triton.Config` during the autotune configuration phase. For details, see [Autotune Example](../examples/06_autotune_example.md)."

